   - `seat_holds`: INDEX(journey_id, seat_code), INDEX(expires_at, status)
   - `routes`: INDEX(company_id, status), INDEX(origin_station_id, destination_station_id)
5. **Pagination:** All list endpoints must support `?page=1&limit=20`
6. **Image Optimization:** WebP format, multiple sizes (thumbnail, medium, full)

